# ExoMind Repository Licensing

This repository contains materials governed by different terms. No license is
granted by implication beyond the permissions stated below.

## Software implementation

The following software file is licensed in its entirety under the
[Apache License, Version 2.0](./LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt):

- `docs/styles.css`

Future software releases are covered by Apache-2.0 only when their file,
directory, or accompanying documentation expressly says so. All other
ExoMind-authored project materials in the current repository are outside the
Apache-2.0 grant unless expressly identified otherwise.

## Research content and brand assets

Apache-2.0 does **not** apply to:

- `Paper.pdf` or the paper's text, tables, equations, captions, figures, and
  other substantive content;
- research descriptions, benchmark results, evaluation data, and scientific
  figures presented in `README.md`, `CITATION.cff`, or `docs/`;
- `docs/index.html` and `docs/script.js`, which mix website implementation with
  reserved research, evaluation, and presentation content;
- `docs/benchmark-data.js` and `docs/performance-data.js`, which contain
  research-result and visualization data rather than general-purpose software;
- `ExoMind.png`, the ExoMind name and logo, favicons, wordmarks, avatars, and
  other ExoMind brand assets; or
- third-party names, logos, trademarks, and other third-party materials.

The ExoMind research content and brand assets are governed by
[CONTENT_RIGHTS.md](./CONTENT_RIGHTS.md). Third-party materials remain subject
to the rights and terms of their respective owners; see
[NOTICE.md](./NOTICE.md).
